server/workflows.py builds ComfyUI graphs that mirror the official Comfy-Org MiniMax H3 templates using native ComfyUI nodes.

The example clips and pictures in examples/ are AI-generated (Qwen-Image 2.1 and MiniMax H3); every person, animal and place
in them is synthetic. They are provided under CC BY 4.0 for testing this app, subject to the licenses of the models that made them.
